AI: 
                              Root Cause Analysis                               

ShopWorkerDown alert is firing because the worker deployment in namespace shop  
has 0 available replicas.                                                       

                                Root Cause Chain                                

 1 Worker pod crashing (worker-7496d4d8b-w5tpw): CrashLoopBackOff with 8        
   restarts                                                                     
    • Logs show: "worker: cannot reach postgres"                                
    • Worker script exits with code 1 when it cannot connect to postgres on port
      5432                                                                      
 2 Postgres pod crashing (postgres-594bbc787f-5nfb7): CrashLoopBackOff with 9   
   restarts                                                                     
    • Root cause: Missing required environment variable POSTGRES_PASSWORD       
    • Postgres logs: "Database is uninitialized and superuser password is not   
      specified. You must specify POSTGRES_PASSWORD to a non-empty value"       
 3 Service has no endpoints: The postgres service exists but has no endpoints   
   because the postgres pod never becomes ready                                 

                                      Fix                                       

Set the POSTGRES_PASSWORD environment variable in the postgres deployment:      

                                                                                
 kubectl set env deployment/postgres -n shop POSTGRES_PASSWORD=<your-password>  
                                                                                

Or use POSTGRES_HOST_AUTH_METHOD=trust (not recommended for production):        

                                                                                
 kubectl set env deployment/postgres -n shop POSTGRES_HOST_AUTH_METHOD=trust    
                                                                                

Once postgres starts successfully, the worker pod will connect and become       
available, resolving the alert.                                                 
